<title>USA: US high-yld fund cash outflows $31.6 mln latest wk.</title>
<headline>US high-yld fund cash outflows $31.6 mln latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. high-yield mutual fund cash outflows totaled $31.6 million in the week ended May 28, according to AMG Data Services.</p>
<p>The latest number represents the first negative read of junk bond cash flows in the past seven weeks, AMG said. But flows had been on a steady decline since the record $1.34 billion of inflows was posted in early May.</p>
